## Original Content
Avantika and Jack Martin are thanking viewers after the news that their 'Friends'-esque series — Kaling's first sole creator credit since 'The Mindy Project' — has not been renewed for a second season at Hulu.

## Summary
Hulu cancels 'Not Suitable for Work' after one season, a 'Friends'-esque series and Mindy Kaling's first sole creator project since 'The Mindy Project'. Cast members Avantika and Jack Martin express gratitude to viewers. Kaling reflects on her positive experience making the show.

